### Review System Test Endpoints
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or curl
### All endpoints require the global prefix: /api/v1

### 1. Customer - Create Review
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/reviews
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "YOUR_BOOKING_ID_HERE",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent service! Very professional and friendly staff."
}

### 2. Customer - Get My Reviews
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/reviews/my-reviews
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Customer - Get Specific Review
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Customer - Update Review
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Good service, but could improve on timing."
}

### 5. Customer - Delete Review
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 6. Business Owner - Get My Business Reviews
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/business-owner/reviews/my-reviews
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Business Owner - Get Specific Review
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/business-owner/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 8. Business Owner - Approve/Disapprove Review
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/business-owner/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE/approve
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isApproved": true
}

### 9. Business Owner - Delete Review
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/business-owner/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 10. Admin - Get All Reviews
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 11. Admin - Get All Reviews with Filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews?rating=5&isApproved=true&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 12. Admin - Get Review by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 13. Admin - Update Any Review
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Updated comment by admin",
  "isApproved": true
}

### 14. Admin - Delete Any Review
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 15. Admin - Get Reviews by Business Owner
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews/business/BUSINESS_OWNER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 16. Admin - Get Reviews by Customer
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews/customer/CUSTOMER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 17. Test with Query Parameters - Customer Reviews with Rating Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/customer/reviews/my-reviews?rating=5&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CUSTOMER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 18. Test with Query Parameters - Business Owner Reviews with Approval Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/business-owner/reviews/my-reviews?isApproved=false&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_BUSINESS_OWNER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 19. Test with Query Parameters - Admin Reviews with Multiple Filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews?businessOwnerId=BUSINESS_OWNER_ID_HERE&rating=4&isApproved=true&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 20. Test Pagination - Admin Reviews
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/reviews?page=2&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
